  // the lifetime of the tab. After admin deletes / renames a target:
  //   * the cached config still lists the deleted target,
  //   * every expanded row keeps rendering a tab + dataset for it,
  //   * and the one last tcping_data entry that was in SystemMetric
  //     before the cleanup landed looked to the user like "a leftover
  //     first point that never goes away".
  //
  // The fix is to invalidate the cache, re-fetch the fresh config, and
